^{:go/end 454} (go/func addrComponent "addrComponent returns the binary (component) of the stored element in a at index, for operand\nof type aclass.\n\nFor example, for operand of type AC_ARNG, it has 2 permissible components (identified by index)\n 0. register: <reg>\n 1. arrangement: <T>\n\nThey are stored in a.Reg as:\n\n\treg | (arrangement << 5)\n\nMore details are in the comments in the switch cases of this function.\n" ^uint32 [^{:tag (* obj/Addr)} a ^AClass acl ^int index]
